  "description": "Gangju Lee is a new star in the K-pop world. When a stalker starts to get too close, his CEO insists on hiring a security detail. Han-ah Dae is now in charge of Gangju’s protection and deems it safest that the two live together. Gangju initially rejects the idea until he sees the many benefits of having an extremely hot roommate who will guard him at all costs and has a knack for anticipating even his most minor needs. And Gangju has some pretty big needs that only Han-ah is equipped to fill… \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
